  "instrument": "TMA1995",
  "kind": "section",
  "number": "112",
  "ref": "TMA1995/s112",
  "text": "This Part makes provision: (a) for recording in the Register claims to interests in, and rights in respect of, registered trade marks that may not be so recorded under another Part; and (b) for the Registrar to keep a record of claims to interests in, and rights in respect of, trade marks for which registration is sought. Note: For registered trade mark see section 6.",
